<title>BELGIUM: Ostend airport traffic falls in February.</title>
<headline>Ostend airport traffic falls in February.</headline>
<dateline>OSTEND 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ostend airport cargo traffic fell in February to 7,145 tonnes from 8,094 tonnes in the same 1996 month, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>					 Feb 96	     Feb 97</p>
<p>    Cargo    (tonnes)	    7,145		8,094</p>
<p>    Aircraft movements	   2,194		2,540</p>
<p>    Passenger traffic	    6,102		5,081</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542-7706 Fax+5017</p>
</text>
